{"componentChunkName":"component---src-pages-new-projects-js","path":"new-projects/in-beverly-gardens","result":{"serverData":{"data":{"status":true,"hits":[{"rank":null,"slug":"beverly-gardens-hmb-homes-discovery-gardens","about":"Beverly Gardens is an elegant minimalist high-rise complex by developer HMB Homes located in Al Furjan, next to Discovery Gardens metro station. The complex is a true architectural masterpiece, the design is a perfect blend of aesthetics and functionality. For sale are presented studios and spacious apartments with 1 and 2 bedrooms, in residences designed private pools. Interiors are made in a modern style with the use of delicate shades, which creates a cozy atmosphere.Premium world-class amenities are provided for residents: a gym, a large infinity pool on a podium with an endless view of the cityscape, a movie theater, a children's playground, a relaxation area with a fire, a barbecue area. Walking and jogging paths are also provided on the territory of the complex. Schools, kindergartens and medical centers are within walking distance.The Al Furjan neighborhood is surrounded by two highways, Sheikh Zayed Road and Sheikh Mohammed Bin Zayed Road, allowing residents quick access to Dubai's attractions. Dubai Marina, JBR Beach, Jumeirah Lake Towers, Emirates Golf Club are just a 15-minute drive away, while Global Village, IMG World, Downtown, Burj Khalifa and Dubai Mall can be reached within a 20-minute drive.","price":950000,"title":"Beverly Gardens","bitrix":{"id":721,"pf_id":"are.2.13628","source":null,"project_id":"Beverly Gardens","tower_name":null,"campaign_name":"Beverly Gardens","property_type":"Apartment","developer_name":"HMB Homes","project_location":"Discovery Gardens"},"images":[{"340x252":"https://d3h330vgpwpjr8.cloudfront.net/x/off-plan/951/images/2024/03/05/340x252/MblXafi3b6lVsMysz3mWVGpseppHJ33KQgNS3orH.webp","464x312":"https://d3h330vgpwpjr8.cloudfront.net/x/off-plan/951/images/2024/03/05/464x312/MblXafi3b6lVsMysz3mWVGp